\newlabel{tab:rot}{{4}{7}{\textbf {Takeaway: the identical sample text gains up to $+9.5$ of 10 points when the rotated reference matches it, samples matching the displaced reference lose a roughly symmetric amount, blind margins on the same split are mostly null, and whenever a matching answer is on offer the referenced judge selects it nearly always.}}{table.caption.11}{}}
